Third-party software used by this repository
============================================

Province Forge (vendor/province-forge, git submodule)
  https://github.com/Ex-aequo/Province-Forge — Ex-Aequo Games (proprietary, same owner).
  Map generator and map view used by the game server and both frontends.

JavaScript libraries (installed with npm, not vendored):
  React (MIT), Vite (MIT), d3-delaunay (ISC), simplex-noise (MIT), @napi-rs/canvas (MIT)

Python libraries (installed separately, not vendored):
  FastAPI (MIT), Uvicorn (BSD-3-Clause), SQLAlchemy (MIT), psycopg (LGPL-3.0), NumPy (BSD-3-Clause),
  SciPy (BSD-3-Clause), Pillow (MIT-CMU)

Fonts loaded at runtime from Google Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1):
  IM Fell English, IM Fell English SC, Spectral

Earlier versions of this repository used Azgaar's Fantasy Map Generator (MIT) as an external
tool; it is no longer used (see docs/decisoes.md, 2026-10-16).
